cff-version: 1.2.0 message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite this repository and the associated research article when available." type: software title: "PINN-Based Geodesic Computation and Visualization on Riemannian Manifolds" authors:

family-names: "Bhattacharyya" given-names: "Sujit" version: "1.0.0" date-released: "2026-10-22" url: "https://github.com/sujitbhattacharyya/PINN-and-Geodesic-Equations-3D" license: "Apache-2.0" abstract: "A Python implementation for solving geodesic equations on a Riemannian manifold using Physics-Informed Neural Networks (PINNs), comparing the solutions with numerical integration, and visualizing geodesic spheres and their intrinsic geometric properties."
